{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reject `codec:` frames that do not contain an SDK envelope.** `deserializeResult` intentionally accepts legacy raw strings, so a malformed `codec:ordinary-json` response is passed to user SerDes; the error path similarly treats it as an ordinary `InvokeFailedException`. Require codec-framed result/error payloads to be valid payload envelopes before consuming them, and add malformed codec-frame tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7om19E","finding_digest":"984dfa8726ca1f47de5b42812def73ee52ab279b3ac2028aae5a469a31594f86","finding_id":"arf_v1_tbg7vbzgzipupxs3ikas333t5z","finding_key":"sdk/operation/invokeoperation::decode-framed-output::codec-envelope-validation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/invokeoperation::decode-framed-output::codec-envelope-validation","line":116,"observation_digest":"909389c5a3bc80bd5dfa85b2a7d69f51473d101a8529096c0aa4051e808e49e9","observation_id":"aro_v1_scjytrndxsal2xp2qwzkpvu7kf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/InvokeOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T08:59:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_o5tczbwwcapt6jrhh7tfmvnqkr","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"ad31d2beb7dabcd8cceccd91680521f642371b36","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_jwpd2mcmk7fybsykrl6eqkm2ak","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T08:59:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
